    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d408-a1">

                <pb facs="0660" n="640" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg640"/>

                <head>Messrs. Anderson, Saxon &amp; Co. to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cape Town, Cape of Good
                            Hope</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-12-03"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 3, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> We have this day sent to Messrs. C. J. and
                    F. W. Coggill, of New York city, instructions, and a power of attorney, to act
                    for us in the settlement of a claim against the United States government for
                    coal taken by the United States steamer Vanderbilt, which we transmitted to you
                    through Walter Graham, esq., United States consul at this port.</p>
                <p>Should you decide to pay the bill, the Messrs. Coggill will draw upon the
                    Treasury Department, or otherwise, as you may direct.</p>
                <p>We have the honor to be, sir, your most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WM. ANDERSON, SAXON &amp; CO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington.</hi></p>
                </postscript>



                <xi:include href="d408-a1-a1.xml" xpointer="d408-a1-a1"/>
            </div>
